window.READABILITY_DETAIL = {"ka":"KA-02036","longest":[{"text":"A service member's dependent, such as an unmarried child under the age of 18, an unmarried child and full-time student between ages 18 to 23, or others for whom the service member provided at least 50% of their support for 180 days before the date of the application","words":48},{"text":"Twenty days after a parking ticket is issued or the date of the NOL, the Department of Finance (DOF) will send a Pre-Penalty Notice of Unpaid Violation to the address on file at the Department of Motor Vehicles (DMV) for the registered owner of the vehicle.","words":46},{"text":"If you have parking or camera violation judgment debt, you may be eligible to set up a payment plan so you can make a series of smaller payments over time instead of paying the full amount all at once.","words":39},{"text":"When paying by check, you are authorizing the Department of Finance (DOF) either to use information from your check as a one-time Electronic Fund Transfer (EFT) from your account or to process the payment as a check transaction.","words":38},{"text":"If you overpaid a parking ticket or camera violation, a refund is automatically mailed to the registered owner of the vehicle within 30 business days if there are no judgments against any vehicle owned by the same owner.","words":38}],"excluded":[{"t":"DOF","n":24},{"t":"Department of Finance","n":15},{"t":"212-639-9675","n":2},{"t":"212-NEW-YORK","n":2},{"t":"Sheriff","n":2},{"t":"(718) 707-2100","n":1},{"t":"DOF's","n":1},{"t":"DOF’s","n":1},{"t":"NYPD","n":1},{"t":"Sheriff’s","n":1}],"blocks":[{"k":"p","c":0,"t":"Need something else?","s":["Need something else?"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Traffic Ticket to pay moving violations","s":["Traffic Ticket to pay moving violations"]},{"k":"p","c":0,"t":"Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Programs for Businesses to enroll in optional programs that make violation payment and tracking for business-owned vehicles easier","s":["Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Programs for Businesses to enroll in optional programs that make violation payment and tracking for business-owned vehicles easier"]},{"k":"p","c":0,"t":"Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Status to look up information about your parking or camera violations and get payment, dispute, and appeal status","s":["Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Status to look up information about your parking or camera violations and get payment, dispute, and appeal status"]},{"k":"p","c":0,"t":"Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Copy to get a copy of a parking ticket or bus lane, red light, or speed camera Notice of Liability (NOL)","s":["Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Copy to get a copy of a parking ticket or bus lane, red light, or speed camera Notice of Liability (NOL)"]},{"k":"p","c":0,"t":"Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Assistance to get help with a parking ticket or camera violation payment, dispute, or status","s":["Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Assistance to get help with a parking ticket or camera violation payment, dispute, or status"]},{"k":"p","c":0,"t":"Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Dispute to fight a parking ticket or camera violation","s":["Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Dispute to fight a parking ticket or camera violation"]},{"k":"p","c":0,"t":"BQE Vehicle Weigh-In-Motion (WIM) Program to learn about new enforcement program for overweight trucks traveling on the Brooklyn-Queens Expressway (BQE)","s":["BQE Vehicle Weigh-In-Motion (WIM) Program to learn about new enforcement program for overweight trucks traveling on the Brooklyn-Queens Expressway (BQE)"]},{"k":"p","c":0,"t":"There are several ways you can pay New York City parking tickets and camera violations. It is recommended that you pay your parking tickets or camera violations online with CityPay. To avoid penalties, make sure you pay within 30 days.","s":["There are several ways you can pay New York City parking tickets and camera violations.","It is recommended that you pay your parking tickets or camera violations online with CityPay.","To avoid penalties, make sure you pay within 30 days."]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Payment Option","s":["Payment Option"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Payment Method","s":["Payment Method"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Service Fee","s":["Service Fee"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Online and Mobile App","s":["Online and Mobile App"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Credit/Debit Card","s":["Credit/Debit Card"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Pre-Paid/Gift Card","s":["Pre-Paid/Gift Card"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Electronic Check","s":["Electronic Check"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"PayPal","s":["PayPal"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Venmo","s":["Venmo"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"2% for cards, PayPal, or Venmo","s":["2% for cards, PayPal, or Venmo"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Mail","s":["Mail"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Check","s":["Check"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Money Order","s":["Money Order"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"No Fee","s":["No Fee"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"DOF Business Centers","s":["DOF Business Centers"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Cash","s":["Cash"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Credit/Debit Card","s":["Credit/Debit Card"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Pre-Paid/Gift Card","s":["Pre-Paid/Gift Card"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Check","s":["Check"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Money Order","s":["Money Order"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"2% for cards","s":["2% for cards"]},{"k":"p","c":0,"t":"You don't have to be the registered owner of the vehicle to make a parking ticket or camera violation payment. You will need either the violation or license plate number. Anyone can pay your violations for you.","s":["You don't have to be the registered owner of the vehicle to make a parking ticket or camera violation payment.","You will need either the violation or license plate number.","Anyone can pay your violations for you."]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Fines, Penalties, and Enforcement Actions","s":["Fines, Penalties, and Enforcement Actions"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Fines","s":["Fines"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Parking Ticket and Camera Violation fines cannot be changed. All payments should be submitted directly to the Department of Finance. If someone offers to get you a discount or reduction on your tickets in exchange for paying them, it is a scam. Submitting a payment to the scammer will result in the ticket being reinstated and could result in a criminal investigation. If you cannot afford to pay the full amount of the tickets, DOF offers payment plans.","s":["Parking Ticket and Camera Violation fines cannot be changed.","All payments should be submitted directly to the Department of Finance.","If someone offers to get you a discount or reduction on your tickets in exchange for paying them, it is a scam.","Submitting a payment to the scammer will result in the ticket being reinstated and could result in a criminal investigation.","If you cannot afford to pay the full amount of the tickets, DOF offers payment plans."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Camera Violations","s":["Camera Violations"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Bus lane camera: Fines start at $50","s":["Bus lane camera: Fines start at $50"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Red light camera: $50","s":["Red light camera: $50"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Speed camera: $50","s":["Speed camera: $50"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Weigh-In-Motion: $650","s":["Weigh-In-Motion: $650"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Note: if the NYPD issued you a bus lane violation that is yellow, it is a moving violation and the fine is $150. For more information about moving violations, go to the Traffic Ticket page.","s":["Note: if the NYPD issued you a bus lane violation that is yellow, it is a moving violation and the fine is $150.","For more information about moving violations, go to the Traffic Ticket page."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Parking Tickets","s":["Parking Tickets"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"The amount you owe depends on the violation code and where in the City you parked. The violation code is located on the front of the ticket. You can get information about the code on your parking ticket, what it means, and how much each type of parking violation costs.","s":["The amount you owe depends on the violation code and where in the City you parked.","The violation code is located on the front of the ticket.","You can get information about the code on your parking ticket, what it means, and how much each type of parking violation costs."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Get parking ticket code descriptions and fine amounts.","s":["Get parking ticket code descriptions and fine amounts."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Penalties","s":["Penalties"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You have 30 days from the date of the parking ticket or camera Notice of Liability (NOL) to pay the fine or request a hearing. After 30 days, penalties and interest will begin to be added. If the violations go into judgment, additional enforcement actions may be taken.","s":["You have 30 days from the date of the parking ticket or camera Notice of Liability (NOL) to pay the fine or request a hearing.","After 30 days, penalties and interest will begin to be added.","If the violations go into judgment, additional enforcement actions may be taken."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Twenty days after a parking ticket is issued or the date of the NOL, the Department of Finance (DOF) will send a Pre-Penalty Notice of Unpaid Violation to the address on file at the Department of Motor Vehicles (DMV) for the registered owner of the vehicle. This letter reminds owners about an outstanding violation on a plate registered to them and gives instructions on how to pay or request a hearing. Make sure to keep your address up to date with the DMV to ensure that you receive these notices in the future.","s":["Twenty days after a parking ticket is issued or the date of the NOL, the Department of Finance (DOF) will send a Pre-Penalty Notice of Unpaid Violation to the address on file at the Department of Motor Vehicles (DMV) for the registered owner of the vehicle.","This letter reminds owners about an outstanding violation on a plate registered to them and gives instructions on how to pay or request a hearing.","Make sure to keep your address up to date with the DMV to ensure that you receive these notices in the future."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Parking Tickets","s":["Parking Tickets"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"After 30 days, an additional $10 is added to the fine amount.","s":["After 30 days, an additional $10 is added to the fine amount."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"After 60 days, an additional $20 is added to the fine and first penalty.","s":["After 60 days, an additional $20 is added to the fine and first penalty."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"After 90 days, an additional $30 is added to the fine and both penalties.","s":["After 90 days, an additional $30 is added to the fine and both penalties."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"After about 100 days, the violation is entered into judgment and 9% simple interest per year is then added to the total amount due. Each month, one-twelfth of the 9% of the unpaid judgment is added to the amount due, until the outstanding amount is paid.","s":["After about 100 days, the violation is entered into judgment and 9% simple interest per year is then added to the total amount due.","Each month, one-twelfth of the 9% of the unpaid judgment is added to the amount due, until the outstanding amount is paid."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Camera Violations","s":["Camera Violations"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"After 30 days, a $25 penalty will be added.","s":["After 30 days, a $25 penalty will be added."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"After 65 days, a Final Notice is mailed.","s":["After 65 days, a Final Notice is mailed."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"After about 75 days, the violation is entered into judgment and 9% simple interest per year is then added to the total amount due. Each month, one-twelfth of the 9% of the unpaid judgment is added to the amount due, until the outstanding amount is paid.","s":["After about 75 days, the violation is entered into judgment and 9% simple interest per year is then added to the total amount due.","Each month, one-twelfth of the 9% of the unpaid judgment is added to the amount due, until the outstanding amount is paid."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If you believe you shouldn't have been charged interest or were charged an incorrect amount of interest, you can request a penalty adjustment. For more information, visit the Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Assistance page.","s":["If you believe you shouldn't have been charged interest or were charged an incorrect amount of interest, you can request a penalty adjustment.","For more information, visit the Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Assistance page."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Enforcement Actions","s":["Enforcement Actions"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Booting and Towing","s":["Booting and Towing"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"When the combined judgment debt owed for parking tickets and camera violations exceeds $350 for all vehicles registered to the same owner, any of those vehicles may be booted or towed. For example, if you own two vehicles and have an $80 bus lane camera violation in judgment on one car and $271 in parking violations in judgment on the other car, either car may be booted.","s":["When the combined judgment debt owed for parking tickets and camera violations exceeds $350 for all vehicles registered to the same owner, any of those vehicles may be booted or towed.","For example, if you own two vehicles and have an $80 bus lane camera violation in judgment on one car and $271 in parking violations in judgment on the other car, either car may be booted."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If your vehicle is booted, a booting fee and marshal or sheriff fees will be added to the judgment amount owed.","s":["If your vehicle is booted, a booting fee and marshal or sheriff fees will be added to the judgment amount owed."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If you don't resolve your judgment debt within 48 hours of being booted, or if your vehicle meets the criteria for an immediate tow, then a tow fee will be added. Vehicles that remain in the tow pound will be charged a storage fee after the first day they are brought into the pound.","s":["If you don't resolve your judgment debt within 48 hours of being booted, or if your vehicle meets the criteria for an immediate tow, then a tow fee will be added.","Vehicles that remain in the tow pound will be charged a storage fee after the first day they are brought into the pound."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If you don't pay the total amount owed, the vehicle will be auctioned. To learn more about booting and towing, visit the Booted Vehicle or Towed Vehicle page.","s":["If you don't pay the total amount owed, the vehicle will be auctioned.","To learn more about booting and towing, visit the Booted Vehicle or Towed Vehicle page."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Other Enforcement Actions","s":["Other Enforcement Actions"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"In addition to booting and towing, DOF may take other enforcement actions against the registered owner of the vehicle.","s":["In addition to booting and towing, DOF may take other enforcement actions against the registered owner of the vehicle."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"DOF may:","s":["DOF may:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Garnish your wages","s":["Garnish your wages"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Restrain your bank accounts","s":["Restrain your bank accounts"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Defer or suspend your NY State vehicle registration","s":["Defer or suspend your NY State vehicle registration"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Place a lien against your real property","s":["Place a lien against your real property"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Refer your account to a collection agency","s":["Refer your account to a collection agency"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Beware of Scams","s":["Beware of Scams"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Protect yourself against fraud. Please disregard any unsolicited notice, text, email, or advertisement that:","s":["Protect yourself against fraud.","Please disregard any unsolicited notice, text, email, or advertisement that:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Demands payment","s":["Demands payment"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Refers to Criminal Court for outstanding parking tickets or camera violations","s":["Refers to Criminal Court for outstanding parking tickets or camera violations"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Promises to get you a discount on your parking ticket or boot removal","s":["Promises to get you a discount on your parking ticket or boot removal"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"There are no discounts on parking tickets, camera violations, or boot removals","s":["There are no discounts on parking tickets, camera violations, or boot removals"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Do not click on any links to make a payment. You should check to see if you have any outstanding violations using the parking or camera violation online lookup and pay DOF directly.","s":["Do not click on any links to make a payment.","You should check to see if you have any outstanding violations using the parking or camera violation online lookup and pay DOF directly."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Submitting a payment to the scammer will not satisfy the ticket and could result in a criminal investigation. If you cannot afford to pay the full amount of the tickets, DOF offers payment plans, go to the Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Payment Plan page.","s":["Submitting a payment to the scammer will not satisfy the ticket and could result in a criminal investigation.","If you cannot afford to pay the full amount of the tickets, DOF offers payment plans, go to the Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Payment Plan page."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Take these steps to protect yourself:","s":["Take these steps to protect yourself:"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Parking Tickets and/or Camera Violations should only be paid to DOF online through CityPay, by mail, or in person at a DOF Business Center.","s":["Parking Tickets and/or Camera Violations should only be paid to DOF online through CityPay, by mail, or in person at a DOF Business Center."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If your vehicle has been booted, please use the Booted Vehicle","s":["If your vehicle has been booted, please use the Booted Vehicle"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can report suspected fraud to the Sheriff’s Office at (718) 707-2100","s":["You can report suspected fraud to the Sheriff’s Office at (718) 707-2100"]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Pay Online","s":["Pay Online"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can pay a parking ticket or camera violation online.","s":["You can pay a parking ticket or camera violation online."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Use CityPay to pay a parking ticket or camera violation.","s":["Use CityPay to pay a parking ticket or camera violation."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Note: you can't pay a parking or camera violation online if your vehicle has been booted or towed. To learn how to pay violations when a vehicle has been booted, visit the Booted Vehicle page. For towed vehicles, visit the Towed Vehicle Reclaim from Marshal or Sheriff page.","s":["Note: you can't pay a parking or camera violation online if your vehicle has been booted or towed.","To learn how to pay violations when a vehicle has been booted, visit the Booted Vehicle page.","For towed vehicles, visit the Towed Vehicle Reclaim from Marshal or Sheriff page."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"How to Pay","s":["How to Pay"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Go to the CityPay website. Using Firefox isn't recommended because you may not be able to input all of the requested information.","s":["Go to the CityPay website.","Using Firefox isn't recommended because you may not be able to input all of the requested information."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Search for the violations you owe using the ticket or Notice of Liability (NOL) number or your license plate number.","s":["Search for the violations you owe using the ticket or Notice of Liability (NOL) number or your license plate number."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Decide how much you want to pay. The full fine and penalty amounts are displayed, but you can make a partial payment by entering the amount you want to pay. Add the selected items to cart and proceed to checkout.","s":["Decide how much you want to pay.","The full fine and penalty amounts are displayed, but you can make a partial payment by entering the amount you want to pay.","Add the selected items to cart and proceed to checkout."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Choose your payment method by selecting one of the tabs at the top of the payment details page and enter all of the required information. Make sure that your billing address matches the address for your credit or debit card and the Card Verification Value (CVV) is correct, or the payment won't go through.","s":["Choose your payment method by selecting one of the tabs at the top of the payment details page and enter all of the required information.","Make sure that your billing address matches the address for your credit or debit card and the Card Verification Value (CVV) is correct, or the payment won't go through."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Review the payment information carefully before submitting. You can't cancel, change, or delay the payment once it's been submitted.","s":["Review the payment information carefully before submitting.","You can't cancel, change, or delay the payment once it's been submitted."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Submit your payment.","s":["Submit your payment."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Print the receipt screen or confirmation email for your records.","s":["Print the receipt screen or confirmation email for your records."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Payment Methods","s":["Payment Methods"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can pay online using:","s":["You can pay online using:"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Credit card (Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover, or foreign cards with CVVs)","s":["Credit card (Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover, or foreign cards with CVVs)"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Debit card (Visa or MasterCard logo)","s":["Debit card (Visa or MasterCard logo)"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Pre-paid or gift card (Visa or MasterCard logo)","s":["Pre-paid or gift card (Visa or MasterCard logo)"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Electronic check","s":["Electronic check"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"PayPal","s":["PayPal"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Venmo","s":["Venmo"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Service Fee","s":["Service Fee"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"A 2% service fee is added for credit, debit, pre-paid or gift card, PayPal, and Venmo payments. There's no fee for payments by electronic check.","s":["A 2% service fee is added for credit, debit, pre-paid or gift card, PayPal, and Venmo payments.","There's no fee for payments by electronic check."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Proof of Payment","s":["Proof of Payment"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"When you pay online and your payment goes through, you'll get a payment receipt screen, and if you provided an email address you'll also get a confirmation email. Make sure to print both for your records as proof of attempted payment.","s":["When you pay online and your payment goes through, you'll get a payment receipt screen, and if you provided an email address you'll also get a confirmation email.","Make sure to print both for your records as proof of attempted payment."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Each shows:","s":["Each shows:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Your receipt number","s":["Your receipt number"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Each ticket and/or violation you paid","s":["Each ticket and/or violation you paid"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"The total amount you paid","s":["The total amount you paid"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If your credit card, PayPal, or Venmo payment didn't go through, you won't get a receipt. Instead, you'll see a message that says \"Unable to process payment. Declined.\"","s":["If your credit card, PayPal, or Venmo payment didn't go through, you won't get a receipt.","Instead, you'll see a message that says \"Unable to process payment.","Declined.\""]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"The confirmation email will be from noreply@finance.nyc.gov. Keep this email for future reference. If you don't see the email, check your Junk or Spam folder.","s":["The confirmation email will be from noreply@finance.nyc.gov.","Keep this email for future reference.","If you don't see the email, check your Junk or Spam folder."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If you submit an e-check payment that is later returned as a no-good check, DOF will send a notification of this return to the email address that you provide at the time of payment. The original amount due will be reinstated, as well as any late fees, penalties, or booting-related fees that may have been in place at the time of your original payment. Additional penalties and interest will continue to accrue until a new payment is received.","s":["If you submit an e-check payment that is later returned as a no-good check, DOF will send a notification of this return to the email address that you provide at the time of payment.","The original amount due will be reinstated, as well as any late fees, penalties, or booting-related fees that may have been in place at the time of your original payment.","Additional penalties and interest will continue to accrue until a new payment is received."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Processing and Post Date","s":["Processing and Post Date"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Online payments are processed each day at midnight. If you search for a ticket or violation you paid earlier the same day, you should see \"Payment in Process\" on the results page. The payment date will be the date that you completed your online transaction. It may take 2 to 4 business days for it to be reflected in the system.","s":["Online payments are processed each day at midnight.","If you search for a ticket or violation you paid earlier the same day, you should see \"Payment in Process\" on the results page.","The payment date will be the date that you completed your online transaction.","It may take 2 to 4 business days for it to be reflected in the system."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Payments made online can't be cancelled, changed, or delayed.","s":["Payments made online can't be cancelled, changed, or delayed."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Credit and debit card payments over $100,000 and e-check payments over $1 million will be split into smaller amounts for processing and will appear on the statement as multiple items.","s":["Credit and debit card payments over $100,000 and e-check payments over $1 million will be split into smaller amounts for processing and will appear on the statement as multiple items."]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Pay by Mobile App","s":["Pay by Mobile App"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can pay a parking ticket or camera violation on your smartphone using the NYC Parking Ticket Pay or Dispute App.","s":["You can pay a parking ticket or camera violation on your smartphone using the NYC Parking Ticket Pay or Dispute App."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"The app makes paying violations quick and easy.","s":["The app makes paying violations quick and easy."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can:","s":["You can:"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Save your plate and billing information for faster lookup and checkout","s":["Save your plate and billing information for faster lookup and checkout"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Access your tickets and payment history (up to 100 violations) at any time","s":["Access your tickets and payment history (up to 100 violations) at any time"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Pay your ticket even if it's not in the Department of Finance system","s":["Pay your ticket even if it's not in the Department of Finance system"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"The app is available for both Android and iOS. You can get it at the App Store or Google Play. The app is free to download and use, but regular service fees for credit and debit card payments still apply.","s":["The app is available for both Android and iOS.","You can get it at the App Store or Google Play.","The app is free to download and use, but regular service fees for credit and debit card payments still apply."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Note: you can't pay a parking or camera violation using the app if your vehicle has been booted or towed. To learn how to pay violations when a vehicle has been booted, visit the Booted Vehicle page. For towed vehicles, go to the Towed Vehicle Reclaim from Marshal or Sheriff page.","s":["Note: you can't pay a parking or camera violation using the app if your vehicle has been booted or towed.","To learn how to pay violations when a vehicle has been booted, visit the Booted Vehicle page.","For towed vehicles, go to the Towed Vehicle Reclaim from Marshal or Sheriff page."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Get the NYC Parking Ticket Pay or Dispute App for:","s":["Get the NYC Parking Ticket Pay or Dispute App for:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Android","s":["Android"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"iPhone, iPad, or iPod touch","s":["iPhone, iPad, or iPod touch"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"System Requirements","s":["System Requirements"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"To use the app, your device needs a data connection, either through Wi-Fi or a cellular data plan.","s":["To use the app, your device needs a data connection, either through Wi-Fi or a cellular data plan."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can use the NYC Parking Ticket Pay or Dispute App on:","s":["You can use the NYC Parking Ticket Pay or Dispute App on:"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"iPhone, iPad, and iPod touch, if you have iOS 9 or later","s":["iPhone, iPad, and iPod touch, if you have iOS 9 or later"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Android systems with KitKat or later","s":["Android systems with KitKat or later"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"How to Pay","s":["How to Pay"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Open the app on your mobile device. Your device will need a data connection, either through Wi-Fi or a cellular data plan.","s":["Open the app on your mobile device.","Your device will need a data connection, either through Wi-Fi or a cellular data plan."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Search for the violations you owe using the ticket number or Notice of Liability (NOL) number or your license plate number. If you've saved your license plate number in the My Info section, the information will auto-populate, but you can still overwrite it if necessary.","s":["Search for the violations you owe using the ticket number or Notice of Liability (NOL) number or your license plate number.","If you've saved your license plate number in the My Info section, the information will auto-populate, but you can still overwrite it if necessary."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Decide how much you want to pay. The app displays the full fine and penalty amounts. You can pay the entire balance or make a partial payment by entering the amount you want to pay.","s":["Decide how much you want to pay.","The app displays the full fine and penalty amounts.","You can pay the entire balance or make a partial payment by entering the amount you want to pay."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Choose your payment method and enter all of the required information. If you've saved your billing information in the My Info Section, the information will auto-populate, but you can still overwrite it if necessary. Make sure that your billing address matches the address for your credit or debit card and the Card Verification Value (CVV) is correct, or the payment won't go through.","s":["Choose your payment method and enter all of the required information.","If you've saved your billing information in the My Info Section, the information will auto-populate, but you can still overwrite it if necessary.","Make sure that your billing address matches the address for your credit or debit card and the Card Verification Value (CVV) is correct, or the payment won't go through."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You will be prompted to enter your cell phone number to receive a 6-digit code needed to continue with the payment.","s":["You will be prompted to enter your cell phone number to receive a 6-digit code needed to continue with the payment."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Review the information you entered carefully before submitting. You can't cancel, change, or delay the payment once it's been submitted.","s":["Review the information you entered carefully before submitting.","You can't cancel, change, or delay the payment once it's been submitted."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Submit your payment.","s":["Submit your payment."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Capture a screenshot of the confirmation page screen or print the confirmation email for your records.","s":["Capture a screenshot of the confirmation page screen or print the confirmation email for your records."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Payment Methods","s":["Payment Methods"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can pay using:","s":["You can pay using:"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Credit card (Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover, or foreign cards with CVVs)","s":["Credit card (Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover, or foreign cards with CVVs)"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Debit card (Visa or MasterCard logo)","s":["Debit card (Visa or MasterCard logo)"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Pre-paid or gift card (Visa or MasterCard logo)","s":["Pre-paid or gift card (Visa or MasterCard logo)"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Electronic check","s":["Electronic check"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"PayPal","s":["PayPal"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Venmo","s":["Venmo"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Service Fee","s":["Service Fee"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"A non-refundable 2% service fee is added for credit, debit, pre-paid or gift card, PayPal, and Venmo payments. The fee is also charged for credit card payments made through Apple Pay and Google Wallet.","s":["A non-refundable 2% service fee is added for credit, debit, pre-paid or gift card, PayPal, and Venmo payments.","The fee is also charged for credit card payments made through Apple Pay and Google Wallet."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"There's no fee for payments by electronic check.","s":["There's no fee for payments by electronic check."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Proof of Payment","s":["Proof of Payment"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"When you pay using the app and your payment goes through, you'll see a confirmation page. You can capture a screenshot and keep that for your records. If you've provided a valid email address, you'll also get a confirmation email within one hour. You can also choose to get a confirmation by text message.","s":["When you pay using the app and your payment goes through, you'll see a confirmation page.","You can capture a screenshot and keep that for your records.","If you've provided a valid email address, you'll also get a confirmation email within one hour.","You can also choose to get a confirmation by text message."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"The confirmation email includes:","s":["The confirmation email includes:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Your receipt number","s":["Your receipt number"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Transaction date and time","s":["Transaction date and time"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"The total amount you paid","s":["The total amount you paid"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Ticket numbers, issue dates, and amounts","s":["Ticket numbers, issue dates, and amounts"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Provisional credit statement","s":["Provisional credit statement"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Keep this email for future reference. If you don't see the email, check your Junk or Spam folder. The email will come from an email address ending in @finance.nyc.gov.","s":["Keep this email for future reference.","If you don't see the email, check your Junk or Spam folder.","The email will come from an email address ending in @finance.nyc.gov."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Processing and Post Date","s":["Processing and Post Date"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"App payments are processed each day at midnight. If you search for a ticket or violation you paid earlier the same day, you should see \"Payment in Process\" on the results page.","s":["App payments are processed each day at midnight.","If you search for a ticket or violation you paid earlier the same day, you should see \"Payment in Process\" on the results page."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"The payment date will be the date that you completed your transaction on the app. It may take 2 to 4 business days for it to be reflected in the system. Once the records have been updated, you can confirm that DOF received your payment by searching your ticket number in the Payment History section.","s":["The payment date will be the date that you completed your transaction on the app.","It may take 2 to 4 business days for it to be reflected in the system.","Once the records have been updated, you can confirm that DOF received your payment by searching your ticket number in the Payment History section."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Payments can't be canceled, changed, or delayed.","s":["Payments can't be canceled, changed, or delayed."]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Pay by Mail","s":["Pay by Mail"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can pay your parking ticket or camera violation by mail.","s":["You can pay your parking ticket or camera violation by mail."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"How to Pay","s":["How to Pay"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Write a check or money order for the amount due payable to \"NYC Department of Finance.\"","s":["Write a check or money order for the amount due payable to \"NYC Department of Finance.\""]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Write on the front of your check or money order the ticket or Notice of Liability (NOL) number, the state where the vehicle is registered, and the license plate number.","s":["Write on the front of your check or money order the ticket or Notice of Liability (NOL) number, the state where the vehicle is registered, and the license plate number."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Mail your payment in the envelope that was provided with the ticket or NOL. Don't include any correspondence, ticket, or NOL.","s":["Mail your payment in the envelope that was provided with the ticket or NOL.","Don't include any correspondence, ticket, or NOL."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Payment Methods","s":["Payment Methods"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can pay by mail with a check or money order in U.S. dollars. Cash and checks or money orders in foreign currency aren't accepted.","s":["You can pay by mail with a check or money order in U.S. dollars.","Cash and checks or money orders in foreign currency aren't accepted."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"When paying by check, you are authorizing the Department of Finance (DOF) either to use information from your check as a one-time Electronic Fund Transfer (EFT) from your account or to process the payment as a check transaction. You can't opt out of the EFT. If DOF processes your payment as an EFT, you won't get your check back.","s":["When paying by check, you are authorizing the Department of Finance (DOF) either to use information from your check as a one-time Electronic Fund Transfer (EFT) from your account or to process the payment as a check transaction.","You can't opt out of the EFT.","If DOF processes your payment as an EFT, you won't get your check back."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Mailing Address","s":["Mailing Address"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Mail your payment using the envelope included with your ticket or NOL. If you lost the envelope, you can use your own, but make sure to mail the payment to the address that corresponds to the type of violation you received.","s":["Mail your payment using the envelope included with your ticket or NOL.","If you lost the envelope, you can use your own, but make sure to mail the payment to the address that corresponds to the type of violation you received."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Mail parking ticket payments to:","s":["Mail parking ticket payments to:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"NYC Department of Finance","s":["NYC Department of Finance"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Church Street Station","s":["Church Street Station"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"P.O. Box 3640","s":["P.O.","Box 3640"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"New York, NY 10008-3640","s":["New York, NY 10008-3640"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Mail camera violation payments to:","s":["Mail camera violation payments to:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"NYC Department of Finance","s":["NYC Department of Finance"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Camera Violations","s":["Camera Violations"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Church Street Station","s":["Church Street Station"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"P.O. Box 3641","s":["P.O.","Box 3641"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"New York, NY 10008-3641","s":["New York, NY 10008-3641"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Processing and Post Date","s":["Processing and Post Date"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"To avoid a late penalty, make sure you mail your payment early enough for DOF to receive it in 30 days. It may take up to 2 weeks for your payment to be processed and reflected in the system.","s":["To avoid a late penalty, make sure you mail your payment early enough for DOF to receive it in 30 days.","It may take up to 2 weeks for your payment to be processed and reflected in the system."]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Pay at a DOF Business Center","s":["Pay at a DOF Business Center"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can pay a parking ticket or camera violation at a Department of Finance Business Center. The centers are open Monday through Friday, 8:30 AM to 4:30 PM. No appointment is necessary, however you can schedule an appointment to ensure social distancing at the centers.","s":["You can pay a parking ticket or camera violation at a Department of Finance Business Center.","The centers are open Monday through Friday, 8:30 AM to 4:30 PM.","No appointment is necessary, however you can schedule an appointment to ensure social distancing at the centers."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Get DOF Business Center locations.","s":["Get DOF Business Center locations."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Payment Methods","s":["Payment Methods"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can pay using:","s":["You can pay using:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Cash","s":["Cash"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Personal or certified check in U.S. currency payable to the “NYC Department of Finance”","s":["Personal or certified check in U.S. currency payable to the “NYC Department of Finance”"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Money order in U.S. currency payable to the “NYC Department of Finance”","s":["Money order in U.S. currency payable to the “NYC Department of Finance”"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Credit card (Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover, or foreign cards with CVVs)","s":["Credit card (Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover, or foreign cards with CVVs)"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Debit card (Visa, MasterCard, or American Express logo)","s":["Debit card (Visa, MasterCard, or American Express logo)"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Pre-paid card or gift card (Visa, MasterCard, or American Express logo)","s":["Pre-paid card or gift card (Visa, MasterCard, or American Express logo)"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"A 2% service fee is added for credit, debit, and pre-paid or gift card payments. There's no fee for payments by cash, check, or money order.","s":["A 2% service fee is added for credit, debit, and pre-paid or gift card payments.","There's no fee for payments by cash, check, or money order."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Processing and Post Date","s":["Processing and Post Date"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Payments are processed each day at midnight. Your payment date will be the date of your transaction at the center. It may take 2 or more business days for it to be reflected in the system.","s":["Payments are processed each day at midnight.","Your payment date will be the date of your transaction at the center.","It may take 2 or more business days for it to be reflected in the system."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"People With Disabilities or Hearing Impairments","s":["People With Disabilities or Hearing Impairments"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If you have a disability, you can ask the Department of Finance for an accommodation. To learn more, go to the Access City Agencies as a Person with a Disability page.","s":["If you have a disability, you can ask the Department of Finance for an accommodation.","To learn more, go to the Access City Agencies as a Person with a Disability page."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If you are deaf or hard of hearing, you can request a sign language interpreter online when you schedule your appointment, or you can visit the Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Assistance page for more information.","s":["If you are deaf or hard of hearing, you can request a sign language interpreter online when you schedule your appointment, or you can visit the Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Assistance page for more information."]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Pay at a Kiosk","s":["Pay at a Kiosk"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can pay a parking ticket or camera violation using a self-serve kiosk at a Department of Finance Business Center. The kiosks are available Monday through Friday, 8:30 AM to 4:30 PM, when the Business Centers are open.","s":["You can pay a parking ticket or camera violation using a self-serve kiosk at a Department of Finance Business Center.","The kiosks are available Monday through Friday, 8:30 AM to 4:30 PM, when the Business Centers are open."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"To find DOF Business Centers, use the DOF Business Center page.","s":["To find DOF Business Centers, use the DOF Business Center page."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Payment Methods","s":["Payment Methods"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can pay using:","s":["You can pay using:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Cash","s":["Cash"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Personal or certified check in U.S. currency payable to the “NYC Department of Finance”. Write on the front of the check your ticket or Notice of Liability number, the state where the vehicle is registered, and the license plate number.","s":["Personal or certified check in U.S. currency payable to the “NYC Department of Finance”.","Write on the front of the check your ticket or Notice of Liability number, the state where the vehicle is registered, and the license plate number."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Credit card (Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover, or foreign cards with CVVs)","s":["Credit card (Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover, or foreign cards with CVVs)"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Pre-paid card or gift card (Visa, MasterCard, or American Express logo)","s":["Pre-paid card or gift card (Visa, MasterCard, or American Express logo)"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"A 2% service fee is added for credit, pre-paid, or gift card payments. There's no fee for payments by cash or check.","s":["A 2% service fee is added for credit, pre-paid, or gift card payments.","There's no fee for payments by cash or check."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Overpayments","s":["Overpayments"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If you overpaid a parking ticket or camera violation, a refund is automatically mailed to the registered owner of the vehicle within 30 business days if there are no judgments against any vehicle owned by the same owner. Overpayments are first applied to any outstanding judgment debt before any funds are returned to the payee.","s":["If you overpaid a parking ticket or camera violation, a refund is automatically mailed to the registered owner of the vehicle within 30 business days if there are no judgments against any vehicle owned by the same owner.","Overpayments are first applied to any outstanding judgment debt before any funds are returned to the payee."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"No request is required, but if someone other than the registered vehicle owner paid and is requesting the refund, they must submit a Parking and Camera Violation Refund Form.","s":["No request is required, but if someone other than the registered vehicle owner paid and is requesting the refund, they must submit a Parking and Camera Violation Refund Form."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Proof of Payment","s":["Proof of Payment"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"When you pay at a kiosk and your payment goes through you will be provided a receipt. If you provided an email address you’ll also get a confirmation email.","s":["When you pay at a kiosk and your payment goes through you will be provided a receipt.","If you provided an email address you’ll also get a confirmation email."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Receipts will show:","s":["Receipts will show:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Your receipt number","s":["Your receipt number"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Each ticket and/or violation you paid","s":["Each ticket and/or violation you paid"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"The total amount you paid","s":["The total amount you paid"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Processing and Post Date","s":["Processing and Post Date"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Payments are processed each day at midnight. Your payment date will be the date of your transaction, printed on your kiosk receipt. It may take 2 or more business days for it to be reflected in the system.","s":["Payments are processed each day at midnight.","Your payment date will be the date of your transaction, printed on your kiosk receipt.","It may take 2 or more business days for it to be reflected in the system."]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Payment Plan and Debt Relief","s":["Payment Plan and Debt Relief"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Payment Plan","s":["Payment Plan"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If you have parking or camera violation judgment debt, you may be eligible to set up a payment plan so you can make a series of smaller payments over time instead of paying the full amount all at once.","s":["If you have parking or camera violation judgment debt, you may be eligible to set up a payment plan so you can make a series of smaller payments over time instead of paying the full amount all at once."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If you stay current with the plan’s payments, your vehicle(s) won’t be subject to towing, booting, and other enforcement actions. Interest continues to accrue on your outstanding liability while the payment plan is in effect.","s":["If you stay current with the plan’s payments, your vehicle(s) won’t be subject to towing, booting, and other enforcement actions.","Interest continues to accrue on your outstanding liability while the payment plan is in effect."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"To be eligible for a payment plan, you must:","s":["To be eligible for a payment plan, you must:"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Have parking ticket, bus lane, red light, speed, or weigh-in-motion camera violation judgment debt","s":["Have parking ticket, bus lane, red light, speed, or weigh-in-motion camera violation judgment debt"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Have a valid vehicle registration","s":["Have a valid vehicle registration"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Be the registered owner of the vehicle, the owner’s court-appointed agent or the lessee of a vehicle who has been designated as liable for judgment summonses by the vehicle’s lessor.","s":["Be the registered owner of the vehicle, the owner’s court-appointed agent or the lessee of a vehicle who has been designated as liable for judgment summonses by the vehicle’s lessor."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Agree to include all open parking ticket judgments not already covered by an active payment plan.","s":["Agree to include all open parking ticket judgments not already covered by an active payment plan."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Agree to a payment plan length of 24 months or fewer. (If the total amount in judgment is less than $350, the payment plan length is 60-Days.)","s":["Agree to a payment plan length of 24 months or fewer.","(If the total amount in judgment is less than $350, the payment plan length is 60-Days.)"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Agree to pay the balance owed on all open judgment violations. If you wish to dispute any tickets in a hearing, you must do so before the payment plan begins.","s":["Agree to pay the balance owed on all open judgment violations.","If you wish to dispute any tickets in a hearing, you must do so before the payment plan begins."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Pay 20% or more of the total amount due at the time you enter into the agreement.","s":["Pay 20% or more of the total amount due at the time you enter into the agreement."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Pay all outstanding booting, towing, and related fees in full if your car has been booted or towed.","s":["Pay all outstanding booting, towing, and related fees in full if your car has been booted or towed."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can learn more on the Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Payment Plan page.","s":["You can learn more on the Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Payment Plan page."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Military Service Member Debt Relief","s":["Military Service Member Debt Relief"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If you are an active member of the military (or a representative of one), you can request relief from parking ticket and camera violation judgments.","s":["If you are an active member of the military (or a representative of one), you can request relief from parking ticket and camera violation judgments."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Debt relief is provided under the Soldiers' and Sailors' Civil Relief Act.","s":["Debt relief is provided under the Soldiers' and Sailors' Civil Relief Act."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"To be eligible, you must be one of the following:","s":["To be eligible, you must be one of the following:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"An active member of the military","s":["An active member of the military"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"A reservist ordered to report for induction or for military service","s":["A reservist ordered to report for induction or for military service"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"A service member's spouse or registered domestic partner","s":["A service member's spouse or registered domestic partner"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"A service member's dependent, such as an unmarried child under the age of 18, an unmarried child and full-time student between ages 18 to 23, or others for whom the service member provided at least 50% of their support for 180 days before the date of the application","s":["A service member's dependent, such as an unmarried child under the age of 18, an unmarried child and full-time student between ages 18 to 23, or others for whom the service member provided at least 50% of their support for 180 days before the date of the application"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"You can learn more on the Debt Relief for Military Service Members page.","s":["You can learn more on the Debt Relief for Military Service Members page."]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Payment Status","s":["Payment Status"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Payments aren't immediately reflected in DOF’s system. Depending on how you paid, it may take up to two weeks.","s":["Payments aren't immediately reflected in DOF’s system.","Depending on how you paid, it may take up to two weeks."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Payment Method","s":["Payment Method"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Post Date","s":["Post Date"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Online","s":["Online"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"2 to 4 business days","s":["2 to 4 business days"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Mobile App","s":["Mobile App"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"2 to 4 business days","s":["2 to 4 business days"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Mail","s":["Mail"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Up to 2 weeks","s":["Up to 2 weeks"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"DOF Business Center","s":["DOF Business Center"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"2 or more business days","s":["2 or more business days"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"If it’s been more than the normal processing time and the payment still isn’t showing up in the system, you can ask DOF to investigate.","s":["If it’s been more than the normal processing time and the payment still isn’t showing up in the system, you can ask DOF to investigate."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Look up your parking tickets or camera violations.","s":["Look up your parking tickets or camera violations."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Call 311 or 212-NEW-YORK (212-639-9675) if you need more help.","s":["Call 311 or 212-NEW-YORK (212-639-9675) if you need more help."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Payer Information","s":["Payer Information"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"For privacy and security reasons, the Department of Finance can't provide information about individuals who submitted a payment for a parking ticket or camera violation. If the vehicle is rented or leased contact the rental company or lease holder to determine if they made the payment.","s":["For privacy and security reasons, the Department of Finance can't provide information about individuals who submitted a payment for a parking ticket or camera violation.","If the vehicle is rented or leased contact the rental company or lease holder to determine if they made the payment."]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"External Payment Systems and Vendors","s":["External Payment Systems and Vendors"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Online payments for NYC property taxes, parking tickets, camera violations, business taxes, and related fees and fines should only be made through the Department of Finance website or apps. Although the City may contract with some vendors, DOF doesn't approve or authorize any external applications, services, or websites that make payments on your behalf.","s":["Online payments for NYC property taxes, parking tickets, camera violations, business taxes, and related fees and fines should only be made through the Department of Finance website or apps.","Although the City may contract with some vendors, DOF doesn't approve or authorize any external applications, services, or websites that make payments on your behalf."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"These external payment systems include, but aren't limited to, the following:","s":["These external payment systems include, but aren't limited to, the following:"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"ACRISasap/ACRIS.com","s":["ACRISasap/ACRIS.com"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Cellum","s":["Cellum"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"FineNYC","s":["FineNYC"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Mint Bills","s":["Mint Bills"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Official Payments","s":["Official Payments"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"PLS Financial","s":["PLS Financial"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"PowaTag","s":["PowaTag"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Precash","s":["Precash"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Prism","s":["Prism"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Rite Check","s":["Rite Check"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"TicketZen","s":["TicketZen"]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Winlt","s":["Winlt"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Any errors or issues that occur as a result of using these sites are your responsibility, including any penalty and interest or other related fees, costs, or charges.","s":["Any errors or issues that occur as a result of using these sites are your responsibility, including any penalty and interest or other related fees, costs, or charges."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"NYC Parking Ticket Pay or Dispute App","s":["NYC Parking Ticket Pay or Dispute App"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"NYC Parking Ticket Pay or Dispute is the official mobile application for DOF. You can use this app to pay or fight your parking ticket or camera violation. Any payments made using this app go directly to DOF.","s":["NYC Parking Ticket Pay or Dispute is the official mobile application for DOF.","You can use this app to pay or fight your parking ticket or camera violation.","Any payments made using this app go directly to DOF."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"ViolationInfo","s":["ViolationInfo"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Violationinfo.com is a vendor of the City that allows you to view photos and videos (if available) associated with your violation. This website will direct you to DOF's website to pay or dispute your violation.","s":["Violationinfo.com is a vendor of the City that allows you to view photos and videos (if available) associated with your violation.","This website will direct you to DOF's website to pay or dispute your violation."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Violationinfo.com does not collect money on behalf of the City. Any payment made for a violation should be made through the DOF website.","s":["Violationinfo.com does not collect money on behalf of the City.","Any payment made for a violation should be made through the DOF website."]},{"k":"h","c":0,"t":"Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Brochure","s":["Parking Ticket or Camera Violation Brochure"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"The Parking Ticket and Camera Violation Brochure provides information about the different ways to pay or fight a parking or camera violation. Information is also available about how to deal with booted or towed vehicles.","s":["The Parking Ticket and Camera Violation Brochure provides information about the different ways to pay or fight a parking or camera violation.","Information is also available about how to deal with booted or towed vehicles."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"Online","s":["Online"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Download the Parking Ticket and Camera Violation Brochure.","s":["Download the Parking Ticket and Camera Violation Brochure."]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Download the brochure in Arabic, Bengali, Chinese, French, Haitian Creole, Korean, Polish, Russian, Spanish, or Urdu.","s":["Download the brochure in Arabic, Bengali, Chinese, French, Haitian Creole, Korean, Polish, Russian, Spanish, or Urdu."]},{"k":"h","c":1,"t":"By Mail","s":["By Mail"]},{"k":"p","c":1,"t":"Call 311 or 212-NEW-YORK (212-639-9675) to request a copy.","s":["Call 311 or 212-NEW-YORK (212-639-9675) to request a copy."]}],"unknown_hidden":[]};
